# Sprite editor

When a sprite needs a pixel change, make it in the dev sprite editor in the browser (`?bake=1`), with that editor's tools. Onion skin is the toggle for matching a frame to the frames beside it.

Write the rig files directly only when the change is a whole clip import, or the editor cannot do it. Do not overwrite a rig the editor has open unless the user asks to save.
